  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7505.02 Operator's Report of Accident. A person required by RSA 264:25 to report an accident shall complete and submit form DSMV 400 “Motor Vehicle Accident Report”, (4/2024) , to the division.\n\nSource. #2250, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2946-a, eff 1-3-85; ss by #4451, eff 6-24-88; ss by #4844, eff 6-20-90; ss by #6249, INTERIM, eff 6-16-96, EXPIRES: 10-14-96; ss and moved by #6337, eff 9-25-96 (from Saf-C 207.02); ss by #8174, INTERIM, eff 9-25-04, EXPIRES: 3-24-05; ss by #8230-B, eff 12-17-04; ss by #10395-B, eff 8-15-13; ss by #13938, eff 4-24-24 (formerly Saf-C 208.02) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 7500)",
